@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = replace-with-local-development-token

### Availability and limits
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calc-jobs/csharp/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compile without executing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calc-jobs/csharp/compile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"CSharp sample","kind":"CSharp","areaId":1,"script":"context.Output(\"answer\", 42);","readTags":"","writeTags":""}

### Preview without saving or submitting SCADA commands
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calc-jobs/csharp/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"CSharp sample","kind":"CSharp","areaId":1,"script":"context.Output(\"answer\", 42); context.Log(\"preview\");","readTags":"","writeTags":""}

### Only after physical verification; the previous target is not resent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calc-jobs/1/acknowledge-writes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}